   (vector "app-kotoba-cloud docs/adr/2609160940-hf-inference-endpoint-iq4xs.md (RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell x1 の価格 $2.75/h・provider nvidia-rtx-pro-6000・本番 vLLM NVFP4 endpoint q38-unc-nvfp4-vllm-rtx の構成の出所)"
